# (P2c ladder slice, LADDER-HEAD) facing R / L over a beard: the bar a column forward, two pixels wide, so the nose pixel
# shows beside it (the guard's eye, nose and mouth all read)
# (FORGE-HELM i3, tools/post3_aventail.py) from T3 a mail aventail hangs from the rim to the shoulders beside the open
# face (`when helm.t3`): the T2 -> T3 step reads as more armour, not a sidegrade
